s","period":"Q4 FY23","ytd":false,"source":"management, Q4 FY23 call","note":"Management confirmed that 3 aircraft are scheduled for delivery in the current financial year for LCA Mk1A."},"status":"kept","reason":"Management reported it delivered (Q4 FY23).","revised":null,"contradiction":false,"verdict":"Delivered 3 units for the 83 Mark1A LCA program in the scheduled year."}],"counts":{"kept":4,"on_track":2,"pending":3,"slipping":5,"missed":1,"dropped":4},"credibility":"Management shows mixed reliability. They successfully delivered specific targets like the 83 Mark1A LCA initial units and grew the order book past projections. However, they frequently miss or quietly drop timelines for prototype rollouts, engine deliveries, and major cost-reduction or deal-concluding milestones.","bull":["Net profit compounded at 23.0% annually over five years, accompanied by an operating cash flow at 144% of reported profit.","Outstanding order book surged to 1,89,300 crores by March 2025, substantially outperforming prior 1,20,000 crore expectations.","The company is almost debt-free with borrowings of only ₹10 cr against a net worth of ₹43,999 cr."],"bear":["Working-capital days severely stretched from 141 to 301 over the past five years.","Operating profit margin recently fell to 24.9%, slipping below the guided 27% target.","Management missed its target to deliver 12 LCA engines in CY25 and delayed the Tejas Mark-2 prototype flight."],"verdict_model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","latest_quarter":"Q2 FY27"},"updated_at":"2026-11-21T17:39:11+05:30"}